# GMS's own text: "a L% chance when attacking to deal 2L% increased damage to an
# enemy. 1% Max HP & MP recovered when triggered." Rolled once per swing, not
# per line: "when attacking" means the attack, and per line the recovery would
# be multiplied by the swing's line count.
#
# The damage is a share of what that enemy was already taking, so a stronger
# swing gives a stronger proc. The MP half of the recovery is dropped: combat
# doesn't track MP.
name: "Mortal Blow"
description: "Chance to deal additional damage to an enemy and recover HP."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_SNIPER skill_order: 5 }
max_level: 10
proc {
  chance: 0.01
  chance_per_level: 0.01
  base {
    damage_pct: 0.02
    hp_recover_pct: 0.01
  }
  per_level { damage_pct: 0.02 }
}
